{"speciesId":180,"names":{"fr":"Lainergie","es":"Flaaffy","en":"Flaaffy","ja":"モココ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"As a result of storing too much electricity, it developed patches where even downy wool won't grow."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Its fluffy fleece easily stores electricity. Its rubbery hide keeps it from being electrocuted."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Because of its rubbery, electric­ ity-resistant skin, it can store lots of electric­ ity in its fur."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"FLAAFFY’s wool quality changes so that it can generate a high amount of static electricity with a small amount of wool. The bare and slick parts of its hide are shielded against electricity."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"FLAAFFY’s wool quality changes so that it can generate a high amount of static electricity with a small amount of wool. The bare and slick parts of its hide are shielded against electricity."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Its fleece quality changes to generate strong static electricity with a small amount of wool. The bare, slick parts of its hide are shielded against electricity."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its fluffy fleece easily stores electricity. Its rubbery hide keeps it from being electrocuted."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"As a result of storing too much electricity, it developed patches where even downy wool won’t grow."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"If its coat becomes fully charged with electricity, its tail lights up. It fires hair that zaps on impact."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"If its coat becomes fully charged with electricity, its tail lights up. It fires hair that zaps on impact."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"If its coat becomes fully charged with electricity, its tail lights up. It fires hair that zaps on impact."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"As a result of storing too much electricity, it developed patches where even downy wool won’t grow."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its fluffy fleece easily stores electricity. Its rubbery hide keeps it from being electrocuted."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Sa queue s’allume lorsque sa laine se charge d’électricité. Il projette des poils électrifiés."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"If its coat becomes fully charged with electricity, its tail lights up. It fires hair that zaps on impact."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Sa queue s’allume lorsque sa laine se charge d’électricité. Il projette des poils électrifiés."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"If its coat becomes fully charged with electricity, its tail lights up. It fires hair that zaps on impact."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Not even downy wool will grow on its rubbery, nonconductive patches of skin that prevent electrical shock."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Not even downy wool will grow on its rubbery, nonconductive patches of skin that prevent electrical shock."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Sa douce laine stocke facilement l’électricité. Sa peau caoutchouteuse prévient l’électrocution."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Su esponjosa lana almacena electricidad. Su piel gomosa evita que sea electrocutado."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its fluffy fleece easily stores electricity. Its rubbery hide keeps it from being electrocuted."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ふかふかの 体毛は 電気を ためやすいが ゴムのような 皮膚の おかげで 自分は しびれない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Sa queue s’allume lorsque sa laine se charge d’électricité. Il projette des poils électrifiés."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando su pelaje se carga de electricidad, su cola se enciende. Lanza pelo que explota al impacto."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"If its coat becomes fully charged with electricity, its tail lights up. It fires hair that zaps on impact."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"体毛に ためた 電気が 満タンになると 尻尾が 光る。 触れると しびれる 毛を 飛ばす。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La qualité de la laine de Lainergie se modifie pour générer un maximum d’électricité statique avec un minimum de laine. Les sections glabres de sa peau sont résistantes à l’électricité."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La calidad de la lana de Flaaffy varía para poder generar mucha electricidad estática con muy poca cantidad de lana. Las zonas suaves de la piel en las que no tiene pelaje están protegidas contra la electricidad."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Flaaffy’s wool quality changes so that it can generate a high amount of static electricity with a small amount of wool. The bare and slick parts of its hide are shielded against electricity."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"体毛の 性質が 変化するので 少ない 量でも 沢山の 電気を つくりだせる。 電気を 遮る つるつるの 肌を 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La qualité de la laine de Lainergie se modifie pour générer un maximum d’électricité statique avec un minimum de laine. Les sections glabres de sa peau sont résistantes à l’électricité."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La calidad de la lana de Flaaffy varía para poder generar mucha electricidad estática con muy poca cantidad de lana. Las zonas suaves de la piel en las que no tiene pelaje están protegidas contra la electricidad."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Flaaffy’s wool quality changes so that it can generate a high amount of static electricity with a small amount of wool. The bare and slick parts of its hide are shielded against electricity."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体毛の 性質が 変化するので 少ない 量でも 沢山の 電気を つくりだせる。 電気を 遮る つるつるの 肌を 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Sa peau lisse et élastique étant isolante, on peut la caresser sans risquer de se prendre une décharge électrique."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Las zonas de su piel desprovistas de lana no transmiten electricidad, por lo que pueden acariciarse sin miedo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"In the places on its body where fleece doesn’t grow, its skin is rubbery and doesn’t conduct electricity. Those spots are safe to touch."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"毛の 生えていない ゴムの ような 皮膚は 電気を 通さないので 触っても 安全 なのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il accumule de l’électricité dans sa toison duveteuse. Il en a tellement stocké qu’il en a perdu sa laine par endroits."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Su lana sedosa acumula tanta electricidad que algunas partes de su cuerpo se han quedado desprovistas de pelo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It stores electricity in its fluffy fleece. If it stores up too much, it will start to go bald in those patches."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"ふかふかの 毛に 電気を ためこむ。 蓄えすぎて ところどころ つるつるに 禿げあがって しまった。"}],"varieties":[{"id":180,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up